    <briefdescription>
<para>This class is basically a combination of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_time_region" kindref="compound">TimeRegion</ref> and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_timer" kindref="compound">Timer</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It allows you to declare a new timer, AND specify the region to time, all in one statement. All timers with the same name are merged. This is primarily used for debugging and for hunting performance problems. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
